   "text": "PHILOSOPHY (council consensus)\nThe build is not a startup — it's a WORKING, EVIDENCED ARGUMENT.\nReviewer path (~10 min):\nREADME 3min → live demo 90s → architecture + one eval figure 3min\nEvery day serves this path.",
