   "text": "PHASE 1 — Days 1-2: Restore + ONE eval campaign\n· git tag evals-first-v1 → harness + 600 gold back AS-IS\n· 3 models: gemini-2.5-flash / gpt-5-mini / haiku-4.5\n· calibration (ECE) + threshold sweep + cost/ticket\n· 'finish or FREEZE' — the science doesn't stretch",
